@startuml
title the committing path, a transfer request applied once
participant "Broker" as B
participant "TransferRequestListener" as L
participant "accounts database" as A
participant "xfers database" as X
participant "Transaction coordinator" as C

B -> L : deliver the transfer request
L -> C : begin the Kafka transaction
L -> L : begin a JTA transaction over both databases
L -> A : debit the source and credit the destination
L -> X : write the transfer row and the PROCESSED_REQUESTS row
L -> L : commit, which Narayana prepares then commits on both branches
A --> L : the balances are durable
X --> L : the two rows are durable
L -> C : send the outcome event
L -> C : commit the Kafka transaction, carrying the consumed offset
C -> C : PREPARE_COMMIT, then the markers,\nthen COMMITTED
C --> L : the consumer position has advanced
@enduml
